releases.body:
## What has changed in this version:
* Serial port support;<br>Available through command-line argument like e.g. `M2000 --serial COM7`;
* Added option for 10x (1000%) CPU speed;
* Support for emulating @ifilot's SD-card cartridge;<br>Targeted at developers of SD-card Launcher firmware;

**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/p2000t/M2000/compare/v0.9.5...0.9.6

